- `packages/spec/prompts/create-new-project.md`'s tree vs its config sample;
- `cli.mdx` about :741, the Your-First-App callout on the `create-objectstack` starter;
- `os validate` has no Skills row;
- `Object.values` on an empty barrel is TS2322 for map-supported keys (a spec-side authoring trap).

